    Requires able(actor) and company(actor) and at(actor, site) and at(actor, camp_c) and flashpoint(f_c) and knows(actor, riders_known) and state(gate_bar_c, open) and day(clock) >= 9.
    Time 15 minutes.
    On success { Assert state(gate_bar_c, dropped). }
    Result "A pole of ash, two men, a notch in each post: the bar goes down and the gate is a wall. Nobody says what it is for, and everyone knows.".
  }
