  Observe riders_sign_d at green_d as sign noticed by woodcraft when flashpoint(f_d) and day(clock) >= 7 and day(clock) < 11 "In the dust beyond the last house: hoofmarks, heavy-shod, eight horses or nine, in from the north at night. They did not come into the town; they went round it by the common, and two of them waited at the old milestone, and one dismounted and stood a long time looking at the camp's ground. A troop, and not a market-party." teaches riders_known.
